## Risk Register

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|
| Username migration breaks existing sessions | High | Clear all sessions on deploy, force re-login |
| Permission changes lock out existing users | High | Validate matrix against current usage before deploy |
| Recovery key security (brute force) | Medium | Rate limit forgot-password attempts, use bcrypt |
| Overlay pattern conflicts with existing CSS | Low | Use CSS modules or scoped styles |

